WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back propped if needed, or on the left side.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rest both calves on a bolster or couch.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arms soft by the sides.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Stay for several minutes.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Roll slowly to sit up.
